WEBVTT

00:12:28.995 --> 00:12:31.747
in which Africans can enjoy
modern living standards

00:12:31.771 --> 00:12:33.262
and well-paying jobs.

00:12:33.744 --> 00:12:35.532
Africans deserve this,

00:12:35.556 --> 00:12:39.643
and with one of every four people
in the world projected to be African

00:12:39.667 --> 00:12:41.313
by the year 2100,

00:12:41.337 --> 00:12:42.588
the planet needs it.

00:12:42.612 --> 00:12:43.778
Thank you.

00:12:43.802 --> 00:12:46.771
(Applause)